# The Queen of Dale (cast on turn 1 with Plains and Mox Pearl). Bot1's own Mox Jet, a noncreature spell cast after her, does
# not trigger her (an opponent's spell only). On turn 2 Bot2 casts Ornithopter (a creature spell: nothing), then Mox Ruby,
# its first noncreature spell: Bot1 recruits (draws, discards Ornithopter, a nonland card) and gets a 1/1 white Human
# Soldier. Bot2's two Lightning Bolts the same turn, its second and third noncreature spells, trigger nothing (CR 603.2,
# "first ... each turn"); the Library.Count checks show it.

